			"notes": "Instagram Reels and a comments viewer for Fabric (**Minecraft 1.21.1, 1.21.11, 26.1.2, 26.2, and 26.3**).\n\n### Highlights\n- **Instagram Reels support.** Switch between YouTube Shorts and Instagram Reels in the editor (`]`) or with an optional keybind. Reels get the same frameless HUD, captions, autoscroll, volume, and like controls.\n- **Comments viewer.** Read the top comments on any Short or Reel in a clean side panel next to the HUD. Toggle it with the new comments button or `,`, and scroll it with the mouse wheel while chat is open. View only, no posting.\n- Built-in sign in now works for Instagram too.\n- Fixed the YouTube sign-in prompt sometimes covering the video for signed-out viewers.\n\n### Requirements\n- **Fabric API** (required)\n- **Rinku 3.x** (required)\n- **Mod Menu** (optional)"
		},
