			"notes": "Initial release for Fabric (**Minecraft 1.21.1, 1.21.11, 26.1.2, 26.2, and 26.3**).\n\n### Highlights\n- Frameless 9:16 YouTube Shorts HUD and compact Mini Mode (`[`)\n- Drag-to-move and edge/corner drag-to-resize HUD editor (`]`) with native resize cursors\n- Chat hover controls: like, previous/next, play/pause, hover-expanding volume slider, scaled subtitles, and settings\n- Autoscroll, full keybind support, and smooth action animations\n- Optional YouTube sign-in inside the editor\n- Automatic background throttling (1 FPS) and pause when Minecraft is unfocused or hidden\n\n### Requirements\n- **Fabric API** (required)\n- **Rinku 3.x** (required)\n- **Mod Menu** (optional)"
